==Strategy==
==='''Chapters 1 & 2'''===
Stall the Le'boins and strike them with heavy hitters as you save up money. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] outranges the elephants, so with enough meatshielding, he can kill them with ease.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Here is where it gets a bit tricky, as we now have a Le'noir. Think of it as an easier version of [[Angry Fighting]]. Crazed Bahamut Cat and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] supported by a flow of cheap meatshields such as [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho Cat]] is probably the best option, or you could bring [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] and hope that she can sneak in a hit. For the [[Timed Score Reward]]s, wait until after you beat Chapter 3 and simply rush down Le'noir with Awakened Bahamut Cat and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]].

